Models built with this code
- Rein-r1-0.8B and Rein-r1-4B are adapters and heads on Qwen/Qwen3.5-0.8B-Base and Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B-Base;
  Rein-NPC-4B is Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B with 64 trained embedding rows. The Qwen3.5 models are Apache-2.0
  (Copyright Alibaba Cloud).

Models used to build the data (not redistributed here)
- Teacher: QuantTrio/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-AWQ, Apache-2.0.
- Auditor and judge: Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B-FP8, Apache-2.0.

Third-party data converted for training (not redistributed here; rebuilt from the sources by rein.public.build)
- Banking77, PolyAI/banking77, CC-BY-4.0.
- CLINC150, clinc/clinc_oos, CC-BY-3.0.
- MASSIVE, Amazon Science, CC-BY-4.0.
- Kev decision-v7, jaredpalmer/kev-suites, no license stated by its author; used for training only and never
  redistributed. The released dataset jmc0/rein-decisions holds the synthetic records alone.

Baselines evaluated (not redistributed here)
- Kev-4B and Kev-0.8B, jaredpalmer/kev-4b and jaredpalmer/kev-0.8b, Apache-2.0 (https://github.com/jaredpalmer/kev).
- TinyJev-0.6B, AnkitAI/TinyJev-0.6B, MIT (https://github.com/ankit-aglawe/tinyjev).

The playground (tools/playground)
- Pixel art: "Zelda-like tilesets and sprites" by ArMM1998, CC0 (public domain),
  https://opengameart.org/content/zelda-like-tilesets-and-sprites. Files: tools/playground/assets.
- Loaded at run time from jsDelivr, not vendored: wllama (MIT, https://github.com/ngxson/wllama) and
  @huggingface/jinja (MIT, https://github.com/huggingface/huggingface.js).
